DroidLabX mobile/tablet workbench chrome

Phone (width <768 or height <500, so landscape stays a drawer): drawer,
floating Menu, compact status, hidden menubar, Find bar full width,
panel as a bottom sheet. Tablet: left rail, Find stays in the corner,
panel stays docked. Both: 44px Find, menus, suggests, select rows,
toasts; Chat and Source Control hidden by icon class.
Extensions: on the phone, a full-screen window with Installed, Search, and Recommended.
Tablet and desktop keep the sidebar viewlet. 44px search. Phone extension page stacks actions.

Reproduce: 390x844, 844x390, and 1024x768; e2e in test/e2e/droidlabxShell.test.ts.

